This collection bundles third-party files. Each copied file stays under its original license. The full texts (and upstream NOTICE files) are in licenses/.
Copied workflow JSON is re-serialised (indent=1). A top-level "_meta" key, which is not a node, is removed from the motionfield graphs; nothing else is changed. Copied Markdown has its YAML frontmatter removed and a one-line provenance comment added.
rosesfield graphs partly follow Comfy-Org/workflow_templates (MIT, Copyright (c) 2023-present Comfy Org); see licenses/rossaai__rosesfield__workflows.NOTICE.
Comfy-Org/workflow_templates files (skills/*/workflows/ui/*.ui.json) were fetched one by one from raw.githubusercontent.com at main = abb9cf6477b59c52dbe234c67f82318dadd872b2. The repository (4.7 GB) was not cloned.
Bundled node packs keep their own LICENSE/NOTICE inside the folder. assets/motionfield_nodes/dwpose_onnx is Apache-2.0 (IDEA-Research DWPose); see licenses/jalajbhandula__motionfield__motionfield_nodes.NOTICE.

